# Operating-system files
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Dependencies and generated output
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.wrangler/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# Logs and local tooling
**/dev*.log
**/dev*.err
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*
**/.vercel/
**/next-env.d.ts

# Secrets and credentials
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem

# Sensitive or local clinical material
**/patient-data/
**/clinical-data/
**/local-data/
**/recordings/
**/uploads/
**/exports/
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.m4a
**/*.webm
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Supabase CLI generated state (CLI should be run from apps/clinical only)
**/supabase/.temp/
**/supabase/.branches/
